+ * |         step[7]         |                     |     |-------------|base+n*0x1D8+0xD4$
+ * |-------------------------|->base+0x40+7*0x1D8  |     |priority[0]  |$
+ * |                         |                     |     |-------------|base+n*0x1D8+0x74$
